# Display name<TAB>stock NAM application name<TAB>optional arguments
#
# The native shell emits the launcher display name. oa-app-launch passes the
# mapped stock name to LIBNAM_APP_SendCommand(0x106). The active
# nvt.app.debug.ini profile disables Netflix/Amazon/YouTube, so these entries
# only work after the app-manager profile enables them. Extend this file for
# the apps present in the selected profile.
Netflix	netflix
YouTube	youtube
YouTube Kids	youtube_test
Prime Video	amazon
Internet Browser	dialLaunch
